# Optional, gitignored companion to exclude-patterns.txt for patterns that
# only make sense with real, non-public values (a real name in a path, a
# specific host-local directory, etc).
#
# To use: copy this file to borgbackup/config-personal/exclude-patterns-personal.txt
# and set BORG_EXCLUDE_FILE_PERSONAL in scripts/borg-backup.conf to point at
# it. borg-backup.sh passes it as an extra --exclude-from alongside the
# public exclude-patterns.txt when the file exists; it's a no-op if you
# never create it.
#
# Example:
# */Foundation/some-real-persons-name-Photos/
